1. A digital broadcast receiving device comprising:  
a receiving unit configured to receive a digital broadcast signal including broadcasting data;  
a location-information acquisition unit configured to acquire location information indicating a location of the digital broadcast receiving device;  
a reproduction unit configured to reproduce the broadcasting data received by the receiving unit; and  
an output unit configured to transmit, to external equipment, the location information together with the reproduced broadcasting data.
